# SmartGPX

> Convert Google Maps routes to GPX in seconds, plus a full suite of free, browser-side GPS format conversion tools.

SmartGPX has two parts. The paid core converts a Google Maps route into a GPX file, ready to load
onto a Garmin, Wahoo, OsmAnd, Strava, or any GPS app or device that reads GPX — 1 credit per
conversion, also available as a Chrome extension that works directly on a Google Maps page.
Everything else on the site is a free, client-side GPS/GPX format tool: files are parsed and
converted entirely in the visitor's browser and never uploaded to a server. SmartGPX is not
affiliated with Garmin, Wahoo, OsmAnd, Strava, or Google; references to those names describe file
format compatibility only.

